ictatorship; to insurgencies and civil war; to the planning and implementation of the surge and the subsequent drawdown of US troops; to the corrupt political elites who used sectarianism to mobilize support; and to the takeover of a third of the country by the Islamic State. With sharp detail and tremendous empathy, Sky provides unique insights into the US military as well as the complexities, diversity, and evolution of Iraqi society. The Unraveling is an intimate insider's portrait of how and why the Iraq adventure failed and contains a unique analysis of the course of the war.","pageCount":383,"publicationYear":2015,"subjectCategories":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Politics and government","sourceId":"source-open-library-the-unravelling-high-hopes-and-missed-opportunities-in-iraq-emma-sky"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Iraq War, 2003-2011","sourceId":"source-open-library-the-unravelling-high-hopes-and-missed-opportunities-in-iraq-emma-sky"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"British Personal narratives","sourceId":"source-open-library-the-unravelling-high-hopes-and-missed-opportunities-in-iraq-emma-sky"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Foreign relations","sourceId":"source-open-library-the-unravelling-high-hopes-and-missed-opportunities-in-iraq-emma-sky"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"History","sourceId":"source-open-library-the-unravelling-high-hopes-and-missed-opportunities-in-iraq-emma-sky"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Iraq, history","sourceId":"source-open-library-the-unravelling-high-hopes-and-missed-opportunities-in-iraq-emma-sky"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Iraq, politics and government","sourceId":"source-open-library-the-unravelling-high-hopes-and-missed-opportunities-in-iraq-emma-sky"},{"source":"open_lib